				<wikidot:authorName>PeppersGhost</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1553042</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'm really loving this oldschool approach creepypasta you've been doing! Absolutely delicious stuff. I always dig it when an ending sheds new, horrific context on previous details, and this pays off beautifully. The extended ruminations on evolution kinda had the lofty air of a old Twilight Zone or Star Trek, but I appreciated that as part of the flavor rather than a detriment.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
