				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12271885#post-4321665</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12271885/tower-b#post-4321665</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 04 Aug 2019 01:53:01 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>The Great Hippo</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3938622</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="font-weight: bold; text-align: center;"> <blockquote> <p><em><a href="https://youtu.be/AL5R-MaiiHk">I've been dragging my feet across my back</a></em><br /> <em><a href="https://youtu.be/AL5R-MaiiHk">And I've been rubbing my head against my neck</a></em><br /> <em><a href="https://youtu.be/AL5R-MaiiHk">And I've been walking my fingers through my mind</a></em><br /> <em><a href="https://youtu.be/AL5R-MaiiHk">And I've been feeling this feeling in my spine</a></em><br /> <em><a href="https://youtu.be/AL5R-MaiiHk">And I believe I'll be leaving it behind</a></em></p> <p><em><a href="https://youtu.be/AL5R-MaiiHk">When I don't</a></em><br /> <em><a href="https://youtu.be/AL5R-MaiiHk">need</a></em><br /> <em><a href="https://youtu.be/AL5R-MaiiHk">a spine ~</a></em><br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><em>&#8212;Spine (They Might Be Giants)</em></p> </div> </blockquote> </div> <p style="text-align: center;"><em>Yet another creepy-pasta from your friends at Parawatch. ~</em></p> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Need&nbsp;a&nbsp;hint?</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Neoteny is the process by which organisms maintain juvenile characteristics. Under the right conditions, they suddenly mature.</p> <p>Saturation divers go deep underwater, existing in conditions that no other human occupies. And sometimes&#8230;</p> <p>&#8230;their <em>spines</em> mature.</p> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <p><strong>SOURCES:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Images from <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2017190140354_2017-07-09_Seetag_-_Sven_-_1D_X_MK_II_-_22_-_B70I3916.jpg">here</a>, <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/markjhealey/6039081759">here</a>, <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Old_Croghan_Man.jpg">here</a>, <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:6_maja_06_r._ZOO_204.jpg">here</a>.</li> </ul> <hr /> <div style="font-weight: bold; text-align: center;"> <h2><span>Like the article? Click <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-great-hippo">here</a> for more of <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-great-hippo">The Great Hippo's Skippos!</a></span></h2> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
